  RANDOM LANDSCAPE CONTROL — the unstructured case Grover is optimal for
      n   m    deg1     <=2     <=3   <=n/2   d90
  -----------------------------------------------
      4   1   0.267   0.667   0.933   0.667     3
      4   2   0.429   0.857   1.000   0.857     3
